{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2023-03-14 07:00:00', 'title': 'CQG ANNOUNCES STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP WITH BROADRIDGE TO INTEGRATE OMS AND EMS TECHNOLOGIES', 'text': "CHICAGO AND NEW YORK AND BOCA RATON, FLA. , MARCH 14, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CQG, A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF HIGH-PERFORMANCE TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS FOR MARKET MAKERS, TRADERS, BROKERS, COMMERCIAL HEDGERS AND EXCHANGES, TODAY ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP WITH GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER, BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS INC.\xa0(NYSE: BR) THAT WILL INTEGRATE THE TWO FIRMS' EXECUTION MANAGEMENT SYSTEM (EMS) AND ORDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM (OMS) RESPECTIVELY."}